=== STICKY: Every feature in Anatomy 1.2.0: the body and its physics ===
[b]Every feature in Anatomy 1.2.0: the body and its physics[/b]
Each item's measurements are in [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/blob/master/docs/decisions.md]decisions.md[/url] (A-#). [b]New[/b] marks 1.2.0.

[b]The body[/b]
[list]
[*]A real vulva, vaginal canal and anal opening, Nahka's geometry aligned to today's CBBE. 22,488 shared vertices are exactly CBBE's; the 2,811 new or changed ones meet the skin within 0.46 units. (A-4, A-9)
[*]Built from your own CBBE, skin and skeleton by the AnatomyBuilder (the latest zip on the [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/releases]GitHub releases page[/url]). Nothing of CBBE's files is uploaded; Nahka's work ships as a patch, with her permission. (A-23)
[*][b]New:[/b] on 3BBB when you have it (with Skeletal Adjustments for CBBE): the builder keeps 3BBB's own breast bones. (A-57)
[*]The genitals are their own shape with their own material, textured to your skin's tone; every texel outside them is byte-identical to your skin. (A-10, A-22)
[*][b]New:[/b] a real vaginal lining: the canal sampled one texel, now it has its own seamless unwrap (198 vertices) and a mucosa with 14 folds, wet near the entrance. The vulva is untouched. (A-54)
[*]A closed anal canal behind the anus, angled back like a real one, so nothing shows through; an anal penis follows it. (A-50)
[*]Light genital textures: about 53 MB -> 3 MB of video memory at 4K, texel for texel the same. (A-48)
[*]"Opening, front", a BodySlide slider in the Anatomy category. (A-25)
[*]The hip fold: the worst edge stretch in legs-up poses fell from 11.1x to 4.0x. (A-30) The neck seam, with Anatomy Rebuild: 14.4° median → 0.0°. (A-37)
[/list]
[b]Physics[/b]
[list]
[*]Openings open because contact pushes them, never because an animation poses them; the bones are added at run time to whatever skeleton you load (fin tears: kneeling 2,613 torn edges → 0). (A-14, A-21)
[*]Outer lips jiggle and squish aside; the inner lips part around what enters; the anus opens on its real ring. (A-13, A-14, A-15)
[*]A penis collides as one smooth tube: thrust wobble anus 0.69 → 0.21, vagina 0.26 → 0.13. (A-35)
[*][b]New:[/b] contact without jitter: tight contact acts as a constraint, nothing shakes when it squeezes. (A-55)
[*][b]New:[/b] skirt physics for Anatomy Tailor's coats and dresses: 60 skirt bones at the hips pushed aside by the legs; legs through a long coat, crouch/sit/stride 24/38/14 % → 5/17/2 %. (A-70)
[*]Held props collide; a rifle or a mug does not. Anatomy's own physics preset when you have none, following the body the builder built. (A-46, A-47, A-57)
[/list]
[b]Sex, in AAF scenes[/b]
[list]
[*]Auto-aim into the vagina, anus or mouth the pose implies, bending along the canal; deep throat follows her head; a gripping hand is recognised. (A-28, A-29)
[*][b]New:[/b] sex sounds from the engine: every pack's canned body sounds are muted in scenes (measured on 228 sound records of 9 packs) and our own set plays from each stroke's real depth and speed: 9 kinds, 37 clips. With Rapport: moans, pain-pleasure for anal and BDSM, a climax. (A-67, A-68)
[*]The mouth opens to what is in it; lips shrink-wrap it from 15 measured morphs; her face reacts and her brows frown with depth. (A-20, A-26, A-29, A-32)
[*]A thinner shaft and a bigger head (×1.2 to 1.25) per man, on his bones; a slightly redder glans (LooksMenu). (A-31)
[/list]
[b]Men, M-M[/b] ([b]new[/b])
[list]
[*]The builder opens BodyTalk 4's own anus on your own BodyTalk 4 (Nude and Uncut): a canal 8.5 units deep, 4 ring bones with her physics and stretch, the aim and the sounds. Build "Anatomy Male Body" in BodySlide. (A-69)
[*]Men are simulated for Anatomy's bones even under a women-only physics preset. (A-69)
[/list]

=== STICKY: Arousal, settings, Anatomy Rebuild, and help ===
[b]Arousal, settings, Anatomy Rebuild, and help[/b]

[b]Arousal[/b]: every 3 s, each woman within about 43 m moves toward her strongest cause (A-16):
[list]
[*]in an AAF scene: 1.0, half-life 10 s
[*]Ivy's own arousal (CompanionIvy): 0.8, 20 s
[*]a companion's Overture desire: 0.7 × desire, 45 s
[*]watching a scene within about 17 m: 0.55, 30 s
[*]naked: 0.3, 45 s; nothing: fades, 60 s
[/list]
Nipples respond on top of her own body (LooksMenu). Under armour Silhouette marks heavy they stay flat, and re-show when Silhouette rebuilds her.

[b]MCM, page "Anatomy"[/b] (the same defaults without MCM)
[list]
[*][i]Arousal nipples[/i] on: off removes every change this mod made to anyone's nipples.
[*][i]Nipple response[/i] 1.0 (0-2) · [i]Rise speed[/i] 1.0 (0.25-4) · [i]Fade speed[/i] 1.0 (0.25-4).
[*]Sources, each on: [i]Being in a scene[/i], [i]Watching a scene[/i], [i]Companions' own arousal[/i], [i]Being naked[/i].
[*][i]Glans colour[/i] on: off takes it off every man it was given to.
[/list]
[b]Sounds[/b]: on by default; the switch is in Rapport's MCM. Without Rapport the engine still plays the body sounds and every pack's own voices stay. (A-68)
[b]Faces and eyes, with Rapport[/b]: Rapport's face shows in every AAF scene, lip sync is kept, and she glances into her partner's eyes for 4-7 s now and then. (A-27, A-34)

[b]Anatomy Rebuild[/b] (optional, the latest zip on the [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy/releases]GitHub releases page[/url]): every CBBE outfit gets the body's hip handover (a combat-armour leg on all fours 5.10 → 2.25) and the neck seam fix. It never runs BodySlide and never moves a vertex, morph or slider; [i]--undo[/i] puts your builds back. (A-36, A-37, A-39)

[b]Install[/b]: Vortex or MO2; the installer checks your setup first and refuses without CBBE. Manual installs are not supported. Upgrading from 1.1.1: Engine 1.2.0, then Anatomy 1.2.0, run AnatomyBuilder 1.2.0 again, rebuild in BodySlide; saves carry on. Nothing of another mod is overwritten; the builder refuses rather than guesses. Pre-built bodies (Zeroed, Ivy) are optional files for vanilla-skin players, with CBBE's permission and no .tri; they were built with 1.1.1 (no vaginal lining). Steam and GOG 1.10.163 or the Anniversary Edition 1.11.x, with Runtime Database. (A-42, A-43)

[b]Something wrong?[/b] About 10 s after every load the engine writes [font=Courier New]Documents\My Games\Fallout4\F4SE\Anatomy_Health.txt[/font]: the engine, the preset, the body and every simulated actor, and a box only on a real problem. Post it in the Bugs tab. (A-60)

[b]Known limits[/b]: in a two-hole position the aim chooses by geometry alone; the men's canal shows the body's own skin tone; the wrist can show a faint line against the hands.
